Bug 2061218 - Save calendar event edits safely

Save updates or moves events through Calendar transactions, preserves drafts after failure, and closes the dialog after success. Overlapping edits retain request order across calendar moves and recurrence changes.

TB-Tools-Id: 45de7648-f2c3-44b2-90b3-75b973642578


